            {
                "entry_id": "beee23c6-ab90-3a90-8abf-65ded6ddea35",
                "word": "destined",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "494eaff4-1733-3201-815b-fa0bf49b5d93",
                        "entry_id": "beee23c6-ab90-3a90-8abf-65ded6ddea35",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Confined to a predetermined fate or destiny; certain."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0317e4e9-94cf-4982-9834-33e15c3d8313",
                                "sense_id": "494eaff4-1733-3201-815b-fa0bf49b5d93",
                                "text": "He is sure he is destined for fame."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f7b96bdb-fbd2-4e52-8871-e213661b0ea9",
                                "sense_id": "494eaff4-1733-3201-815b-fa0bf49b5d93",
                                "text": "When Hape sauntered over for a try after only three minutes it looked as if England were destined for a comfortable victory, but Georgia are made of sterner stuff, as they showed when running Scotland close in Invercargill last week."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "61dc32e4-d8c2-40cd-810c-6009b70244a3",
                                "sense_id": "494eaff4-1733-3201-815b-fa0bf49b5d93",
                                "text": "The furious reaction in Germany after 200,000 protective masks destined for Berlin mysteriously went missing in Thailand and were allegedly redirected to the US is a case in point. There is no solid proof Trump approved the heist. But it’s the sort of thing he would do – or so people believe."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
